  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "Brute force may scan the array for many candidates.",
      "start_ms": 0,
      "end_ms": 3120,
      "start_frame": 0,
      "end_frame": 94,
      "word_count": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "O of n squared time, O of 1 extra space.",
      "start_ms": 4000,
      "end_ms": 7660,
      "start_frame": 120,
      "end_frame": 230,
      "word_count": 10
    },
    {
      "text": "Hash set avoids those scans.",
      "start_ms": 8140,
      "end_ms": 9760,
      "start_frame": 244,
      "end_frame": 293,
      "word_count": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "Expected O of n time, but O of n extra space.",
      "start_ms": 10380,
      "end_ms": 14500,
      "start_frame": 311,
      "end_frame": 435,
      "word_count": 11
    },
    {
      "text": "In the in -place method, every successful swap puts a value into its correct home.",
      "start_ms": 15120,
      "end_ms": 20420,
      "start_frame": 454,
      "end_frame": 613,
      "word_count": 15
    },
    {
      "text": "So there can be at most n successful swaps in total.",
      "start_ms": 21100,
      "end_ms": 24380,
      "start_frame": 633,
      "end_frame": 731,
      "word_count": 11
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the outer visits and final scan.",
      "start_ms": 25180,
      "end_ms": 27500,
      "start_frame": 755,
      "end_frame": 825,
      "word_count": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "Overall, O of n time and O of 1 extra space.",
      "start_ms": 27500,
      "end_ms": 32340,
      "start_frame": 825,
      "end_frame": 970,
      "word_count": 11
    },
    {
      "text": "Two important safeguards.",
      "start_ms": 33000,
      "end_ms": 34420,
      "start_frame": 990,
      "end_frame": 1033,
      "word_count": 3
    },
    {
      "text": "Only move values from 1 through n and never swap into a home already holding the same value.",
      "start_ms": 34700,
      "end_ms": 41260,
      "start_frame": 1041,
      "end_frame": 1238,
      "word_count": 18
    }
  ],
